OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 6, died after being hit by
OL,4,Avan while playing on bike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old boy died after falling
OL,7,Finto the road and being hit by a van
OL,8,Fwhile playing on his bike, an inquest
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FHarrison Jones had been playing with a
OL,12,Ffriend when he fell into the road
OL,13,Foutside his home in Llanfairfechan at
OL,14,Fabout 17:30 BST on 1 October.
OL,16,FDenbighshire Coroner's Court heard he
OL,17,Fwas struck by a passing Ford Transit
OL,18,Ftipper van.
OL,20,FA post-mortem examination found
OL,21,FHarrison died from severe head
OL,22,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
